  Confirm_DeleteDeck:
  - 'Are you sure you want to delete

    <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>?'
  - "\xBFEst\xE1s seguro de que quieres eliminar\n<color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>?"
  Confirm_SetDeckDefault:
  - 'Are you sure you want to set

    <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>

    to
    a Default Deck?'
  - "\xBFEst\xE1 seguro de que desea establecer\n<color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>\na
    un Mazo Default?"
  Confirm_SaveChangesBeforeEdit:
  - Would you like to save changes made to <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color> before
    editing <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color>?
  - "\xBFLe gustar\xEDa guardar los cambios realizados en <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>
    antes de editar <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color>?"
  Confirm_SaveCopyBeforeSet:
  - Would you like to save a copy of <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color> before setting
    <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color> as the Game Deck?
  - "\xBFLe gustar\xEDa guardar una copia de <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color> antes
    de configurar <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color> como el Mazo de Juego?"
  Confirm_SaveChangesBeforeSet:
  - Would you like to save changes made to <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color> before
    setting <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color> as the Game Deck?
  - "\xBFLe gustar\xEDa guardar los cambios realizados en <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color>
    antes de configurar <color=#FFFFFF><i>{1}</i></color> como el Mazo del Juego?"
  Confirm_SaveChangesBeforeSet2:
  - Would you like to save changes made to <color=#FFFFFF><i>{0}</i></color> before
